WEBVTT

00:37.193 --> 00:41.414
We step to shore in a different age A thousand

00:41.514 --> 00:45.896
miles from the open stage The waves deep and the

00:46.016 --> 00:51.817
current strong We hum the tune of a faded song The

00:51.898 --> 00:56.539
radio plays a foreign sound But we are drifting

00:56.579 --> 00:59.500
above the ground

01:01.861 --> 01:09.235
Like strangers in the stream Waiting for the

01:09.295 --> 01:13.338
dawn to break the dream

01:16.501 --> 01:24.369
Holding on to what we used to know Another place,

01:25.390 --> 01:31.956
another time ago Strangers in the street

01:38.717 --> 01:43.438
Layers piled by the open door A shadow falls on

01:43.478 --> 01:48.559
the wooden floor I see your face in the pan glass

01:49.320 --> 01:53.421
And watch the days as they slowly pass We row

01:53.481 --> 01:57.742
against an invisible tide With nowhere for the

01:57.802 --> 02:00.122
ghost to hide

02:02.923 --> 02:10.231
Like strangers in the street Waiting for the

02:10.291 --> 02:14.332
dawn to break the dream.

02:17.434 --> 02:25.137
Holding on to what we used to know. Another place

02:26.297 --> 02:32.340
and a third time ago. Strangers in the street.

02:36.805 --> 02:42.289
Is I a mirror of time? A mountain we have to climb

02:42.509 --> 02:46.952
The where is cold, the where is wide We have to

02:46.993 --> 02:54.138
reach the other

02:54.778 --> 02:55.259
side

03:19.553 --> 03:26.755
Like strangers in the street Waiting for the

03:26.835 --> 03:30.736
dawn to break that dream

03:33.937 --> 03:41.600
Holding on to what we used to know Another place,

03:42.760 --> 03:49.325
another time ago Strangers in the stream

03:53.550 --> 03:59.236
Strangers in the stream Waiting for the dawn

